<title>SRI LANKA: SRI LANKA 281 FOR 7 V PAKISTAN AT CLOSE.</title>
<headline>SRI LANKA 281 FOR 7 V PAKISTAN AT CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-04-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka were 281 for 7 at</p>
<p>close of play on the first day of the second and final test</p>
<p>against Pakistan on Saturday.</p>
</text>
